      "object_id": "mathia_synthesis_af950ed643513bf25d9a4bcbdd97e58363e1557951806204e6f22e9a43376d13",
      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "The proposed clean proof-status contrast is not supported by the full parent set: one review reports an exact zeta formula and an RH-equivalent ordered one-hole circular-billiard limit, while the Lorentz-gas source explicitly says that a complete equivalence proof is unavailable even for the simpler related open circular billiard. The packet therefore records an unresolved conflict about the circular criterion before any comparison with the Lorentz-gas contour gap can be accepted.",
