      "proposed_content": "Completion packages family-specific archimedean data into functions reflected about s=1/2, and the affine condition 2b+a=1 makes a label map intertwine that reflection. But the permutation audit retains generic off-critical zero quartets compatible with conjugation and reflection, so covariance of a representation does not imply localization of its vanishing set on the critical line.",
